{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nMIRROR成員邱士縉（Stanley）與女友李炘頤（Alina）昨日於峇里舉行浪漫海外婚禮，正式結束9年愛情長跑。多位圈中好友親身飛抵當地見證這場人生大事，當中兄弟團成員在晚宴致辭時情緒激動。現場更意外曝光了一段不為人知往事讓眾人當場淚崩。\n</p>\n<h2>邱士縉李炘頤峇里海外婚禮場面浪漫</h2>\n<p>昨日10月25日天公作美，這對新人在峇里順利舉行海外婚禮，新娘子穿上親自參與設計白色婚紗進場時已經眼濕濕，兩人在宣讀誓辭一刻更雙雙激動落淚。到了晚宴環節，現場特別安排煙花匯演，一對新人在璀璨夜空下浪漫共舞，兄弟團成員Edan、Jer及Jeremy隨後驚喜合唱《My Apple Pie》送上甜蜜祝福，唱畢後更與新郎合體大跳《Bad》，加上Fatboy即場跳舞助興，將全場氣氛推向最高潮。</p>\n<h2>兄弟團成員收到李炘頤親筆手寫卡</h2>\n<p>為了答謝一眾遠赴峇里出席婚禮親友，這對新人提早親手撰寫感謝卡送給每位來賓。Anson Lo隨後在社交平台公開展示收到實體卡片，並清晰影到卡上寫有「我哋一起經歷太多太多！多謝永遠 sweet，永遠細心的你。以後有咩唔開心、或者開心都好，你叫一聲，我哋一定出嚟陪你！Thanks for coming」等字句。據悉新郎哥因為工作行程緊密，圓婚後完全沒有時間留在當地度蜜月，已經火速搭飛機趕回香港準備開工。</p>\n<h2>組合隊友Jeremy致辭重提初見經過</h2>\n<p>出道至今與新郎感情極為深厚並組成「巨龍與豬仔」組合好兄弟Jeremy，在晚宴致辭環節時回憶起三人相識經過，忍不住感觸哭成淚人。他在台上哽咽表示：「記得當初第一次見 Alina 嘅時候都係着一條黑色嘅禮服裙，覺得 Alina 好靚，今晚 Alina 著番同一條裙，就好似去返嗰晚初初認識咁，但係呢幾年大家已經歷咗好多，成長咗，Alina 同阿 Stanley 好照顧我，覺得自己好似佢哋個細佬。」</p>\n<h2>網民洗版式留言祝賀MIRROR成員新婚</h2>\n<p>大批粉絲及網民在社交平台得知婚禮順利舉行後，紛紛湧入兩人社交帳號留言送上祝賀。不少粉絲對於兄弟團特意飛往外地見證這份真摯友情感到相當激動，紛紛留言表示「見到你哋班兄弟齊齊整整真係好感動」、「恭喜晒兩人終於跑完9年愛情長跑」，亦有網民針對新郎哥馬上回港開工一事表示心痛，直指「剛結完婚就要返工真係辛苦」、「希望之後可以補番個靚靚蜜月旅行」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301116483529317_2228327686adf2dddecf2a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IMG_5354.JPG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301116483529317_2228327686adf2dddecf2a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301116998799308_18800722446adf2de2c5b7e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IMG_5357.JPG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301116998799308_18800722446adf2de2c5b7e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301118048337055_5692861486adf2ded7334a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IMG_5355.JPG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301118048337055_5692861486adf2ded7334a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301119237226073_13205544956adf2df95bee8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IMG_5358.JPG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301119237226073_13205544956adf2df95bee8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17930112072911939_808557776adf2e080a2a6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IMG_5356.JPG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17930112072911939_808557776adf2e080a2a6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301122301790247_11556185896adf2e17d2279.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IMG_5360.JPG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301122301790247_11556185896adf2e17d2279.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:37.073404+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1242,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T10:58:23.916824+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T10:58:23.916824+00:00","content_hash":"c9348c0729dfab7939f409c23aad1aa2487ec21b14f22379986a18bff75a9814","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}